# Docs and structure

- **Jekyll + just-the-docs** under `docs/` (not Starlight). Use `title` / `nav_order`.
- **README.md** = operator how-to-run. **docs/walkthrough.md** = TF/CLI depth.
- **docs/cost.md** = pricing, wildcards, renewal — cite AWS pricing/docs.
- GFM pipe tables only; hook `.kiro/hooks/format-md-tables.py` repairs separators.
- Imperative steps; public ALB path vs private path (`alb_acm` default;
  optional `nginx_export`) called out explicitly.
- Never put real AWS account IDs or live private keys in docs — placeholders only.
- Terraform: staged roots `terraform/01-network` … `04-trust`; `terraform fmt` before commit.
- Do not add apply wrappers agents would run; prove scripts under `scripts/` are OK.

See `.kiro/steering/docs-style.md`, `structure.md`, `terraform-stack.md`,
`markdown-tables.md`.
